pack.name=§4Horror Legends: §fBedrock§r
pack.description=Horror in three acts with the legends of Minecraft and the classic creepypastas: Green Steve, The Knocker, Smile Dog, The Lick, The Mimicer, The Boiled One, Jeff the Killer and Slenderman with his eight pages. Structures, lore notes and an introduction.
